00:45:32.333 --> 00:45:33.333
Maaf.

00:45:38.266 --> 00:45:41.233
Saat kau pergi, beri tahu kami.

00:46:29.633 --> 00:46:30.633
Tidak mau.

00:46:43.066 --> 00:46:44.100
Hei, Kak.

00:46:44.500 --> 00:46:45.500
Lihat saja nanti.

00:46:51.500 --> 00:46:53.700
Saat kau pergi, kau harus memberi tahu kami.

00:46:54.666 --> 00:46:57.766
